当然，替换后如下：

The Holy Child: Don’t open the door.

Bishop Lucian: Today is only the First Day’s recitation.

The Holy Child: They said that about the First Day, too.They said it wouldn’t hurt.

Bishop Lucian: I need you to calm down.

The Holy Child: Why me?

