Bishop Lucian:

“I saw it.”

The Holy Child:

“Are you going to tell them?”

Bishop Lucian:

“No. Give it to me. I’ll take care of it.”

The Holy Child:

“Will they know?”

Bishop Lucian:

“No.”

The Holy Child:

“...Then come back tomorrow.”
